# Repository-local scratch space; these ignores do not authorize worktrees.
# Only with explicit human authorization, use /tmp/worktrees/ for temporary Git
# worktrees. Inspect WIP before authorized removal via `git worktree remove`;
# never use raw filesystem deletion or force-removal to discard another's work.
/tmp/
/temp/

